 "note": "Traced over the lidar point-cloud intensity (2020), where the park's lanes show as dark bands under the canopy. Replaced the earlier relief trace of the main road, which ran up to 12 m off its band in places, with the road on its band from the entrance north to the shore junction. Added the shore road east past 052 to 045 and down toward 040, the lane up the north finger round 053 to 063 with its small loop by 064 to 067, the lanes through the 001 to 038 area (the lanes past 038 and 001, the loop past 034, 032, 030 and 028, the lane east past 006 with its spur to 007) and the two lanes through the west peninsula past 095 to 104 and past 082 to 077. Left out: the shore road round 083 to 094 and the lanes round 008 to 026, which show only faintly or among old farm terraces."
